    "faq_zG3iEx": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_eqPWnn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is the U8 designed for?",
            "text": "<p>U8 is designed for people who carry work essentials every day but need a little more flexibility when plans change. It stays compact for commuting and work, then expands when you need extra room for a jacket, gym gear or a short overnight trip.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_VzHDrA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can I fit in the U8 at 19L?",
            "text": "<p>In its compact 19L setup, U8 is sized for everyday work essentials such as a laptop, charger, headphones, notebook, water bottle and other small daily items—without feeling like you’re carrying a travel backpack to work.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_faQPjM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the U8 expand from 19L to 24L?",
            "text": "<p>Simply extend the roll-top and secure it at the higher position to add up to 5L of extra space. It’s useful when you need room for a light jacket, gym clothes, a packing cube or other extras that weren’t part of your morning commute.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_XgrxRi": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What size laptop fits in the U8?",
            "text": "<p>The suspended laptop compartment is designed to fit most laptops up to 16\", depending on the device’s exact dimensions and protective case. The raised compartment keeps your laptop off the bottom of the bag, while EVA padding adds cushioning against everyday bumps and hard set-downs.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_CUVMab": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I have to open the roll-top every time I need something?",
            "text": "<p>No. A rear zip opening gives you direct access to the main compartment, so you can grab everyday essentials without opening and re-rolling the top. It makes quick access easier during commutes, travel and busy days on the move.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_ymcQ63": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the U8 waterproof?",
            "text": "<p>U8 is water-resistant, not fully waterproof. Its weather-resistant outer fabric helps protect your everyday gear from light rain, splashes and changing city weather, but the backpack should not be submerged or exposed to prolonged heavy rain.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_EGAYmQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the U8 comfortable when fully loaded?",
            "text": "<p>U8 uses contoured padded shoulder straps and a breathable 3D mesh back panel to spread the load and improve airflow during everyday carry. At approximately 800g empty, it also keeps the backpack itself relatively lightweight before you start packing.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_kXKNhk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use the U8 for short trips or as a carry-on?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The expandable 19–24L capacity makes U8 well suited to commuting, day trips and light overnight travel while keeping a relatively compact profile. Airline carry-on rules vary, so always check your airline’s current size limits before traveling.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_gtMFa3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if the U8 isn’t right for me?",
            "text": "<p>You can return or exchange your U8 within 30 days, subject to our return policy. It also comes with a 2-year warranty, so you can try it with greater confidence and see how it fits your everyday routine.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
